# Multiple short, time-disjoint future contacts on the 2->3 link.
# Each contact's volume (duration * rate) is far smaller than the 50 KB
# bundle, so CGR must proactively fragment it and spread the fragments
# across successive contacts.
m horizon +0
a range   +1 +3600   2 3   1
a contact +5  +10     2 3   5000
a contact +13 +18     2 3   5000
a contact +21 +26     2 3   5000
a contact +29 +34     2 3   5000
